        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">Visible Ads is a Meta Business Partner. Meta Business Partner is a Meta programme for agencies and other providers, and the badge shows an agency is known to Meta.</p>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">It carries no guarantee of results for your account and does not change what you pay for ads. Pair it with a profit target and reporting you can check.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Approach -->
