        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">Alongside Meta, Visible Ads manages <strong>TikTok Ads</strong>, which suits short-form video and uses the same creative-first, POAS-grounded approach. It also manages <strong>LinkedIn Ads</strong> for B2B and <a href="/ppc-for-professional-services/" class="text-electric underline hover:text-electric-dark">professional-services clients and agency partners</a>. LinkedIn targets by job title, seniority, company size and industry, and it is only worth it when the deal value justifies the cost. See <a href="/ppc-management/" class="text-electric underline hover:text-electric-dark">PPC management</a> for how channels fit under one plan.</p>
